          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;SoF Turns VS into our Bitz</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=227','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Lucane Darkseraphim</font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 11/26/01 8:58:46 PM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>RAR!  Once again we have done it, we killed VS.  Though he has been weak on the loots for a few times he finally shelled out some phat loot this time.  WTG to Haletma on your Donals Legs and to Lena on her wizzy epic staff!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">I knew Karnor's smelled a little odd today, it smelled putrid... then I realized Moonwolf was standing a few feet away from me.  I then tossed Moonie out of the zone and smelled iksar.  After further investigation our druids concluded that VS was up.  We all know VS, he is the floating iksar.  If you gave Bhhaal a black robe and made him levitate, then you have a VS look alike.  <br><br>So SoF decided to take action.  We knew we had to kill VS again and earn us some long awaited phat loots =D  With the superb leadership of Booger, errr Borgir, we were able to smack VS.  With the assistance of the guild VS fell to the ground begging for mercy from SoF.  Of course we were like "pffft ya right, we need your phat loots!"<br><br>With the expert heals of Haletma and Adon and the perfect chain runing I was able to tank VS. *wheee that was fun*<br><br>After he died Bhhaal got to take a peak at what he had for us, he found a wizzy epic staff and Donals legs!<br><br>Gratz to Haletma on your new shiny leggings!<br>Donals Leggings- 26ac 8str 8sta 8wis 30 hp/mana and effect:  Symbol of Naltron<br><br>Gratz to Lena on your wizzy epic piece!<br><br>Nice job all and I am sure that we will once again smell something foul in Karnor's Castle, and I will make sure it is not Moonwolf this time.<br>(oh wait, I can smell him now, he will be up in 3 days, oh man I am good) Stay tuned for the next time VS gets owned by SoF, afterall, we made him our bitz.<br>-Lucane                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         